# Frame hashes of s02e02 (sha256 prefix of the PNG), recorded on 2026-10-15 from the approved
# master (out/s02e02-review-candidate.mp4, sha256 bf979ca9…a1d2): one frame in each movement — the
# two answers, scores to probabilities, the sample spins, the replay, the branches, the tree, low and
# high temperature, the inputs, the next question — the end card last (the platform-neutral card,
# so it hashes as s02e01's does). macOS, Chrome headless shell, SwiftShader. Like the s01e03 and
# s02e01 baselines it belongs to the Mac: other GPUs or Chrome builds may hash differently. Use it
# to prove a change moved no pixel.
# Frames 540 and 3825 re-recorded on 2026-10-15 for the branding correction — the opening and closing
# kickers now read ONE QUESTION, TWO ANSWERS and NEXT QUESTION (master out/s02e02-master-branding.mp4,
# sha256 d2fdedc6…da79); the other nine frames are unchanged. To check:
#   node renderers/three/tools/check-determinism.mjs --episode episodes/s02e02-different-answers \
#     --frames 540,795,1248,1497,2061,2349,2922,3240,3513,3825,4035 \
#     --expect episodes/s02e02-different-answers/three/determinism.baseline
